    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61196" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώδυια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>head</i>: hence, <i>bulb,
			cup</i> of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλεψύδρα</span>, <i><span class="en">
