				<u>Pr.</u>
				914b27
			</span></i> (vv.ll. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωδύαν, κωδίαν</span>:
			these forms, as well as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώδεια</span>
			(q.v.), are prob. derived from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώδυια</span>).</div>
